  "remarks": "Public Joint Stock Company “SDM-Bank” is a Russian commercial bank, focusing primarily on small and medium-sized enterprises. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, Public Joint Stock Company “SDM-Bank” is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
